// Cells. Two islets of glass: the north one (5-11, 2-4) with the compass's desk, the south one (5-11, 9-11)
// with the landing (8, 11). The centre walkway (8, 5-8) is broken at (8, 6-7), and so is the east one
// (12-14, 3), whose end holds the PP Up. The detour is the corniche outside the screens (x 1, y 3-10, two
// wide at y 7-10): from the landing west (3-4, 10), up the corniche past Ludo and gas 07 at its neck (1, 5),
// then east (2-4, 3) to the north islet.
